INT. GRAND EGYPTIAN MUSEUM, TUTANKHAMUN GALLERIES - CONTINUOUS #14#

Dark but for the lit cases. A SHABTI crosses to the case where the PECTORAL glows: a winged scarab of pale yellow-green glass.

