It lifts the pectoral to the light. For one moment the scarab burns green.

It carries it level in both hands, like an offering tray, and walks.

INT. GEM CONSERVATION CENTRE TUNNEL - MOMENTS LATER #15#

Two hundred metres of white concrete. Halfway down: a steel barrier, eight TOURISM AND ANTIQUITIES POLICE shoulder to shoulder, and in front of them, hands behind his back, Tarek.

