INT. GEM CONSERVATION CENTRE, TUT'S BAY, OBSERVATION ROOM - LATE AFTERNOON #18#

SUPER: 4 NOVEMBER. 16:30.

Beyond the observation glass, Tut sits on his bed, watching.

At the steel table: Hale, Tarek, Tomas, Nour, Adaeze.

Two SHABTI stand by the door. The lock-light turns red, softly.

SESHAT (V.O.)
The unveiling is in ninety minutes. I've asked you to stay here, for your comfort.

