INT. ARMY TRUCK, CARGO BED (MOVING) - NIGHT #30#

The army truck bucks east through dead Giza streets. Across the river, Cairo still glows in patches.

Around NOUR: TUT in Tarek's charcoal field jacket, ebony stick across his knees. TOMAS. ADAEZE, laptop. RAMI, splinted hand. FATHI, red scarf, sorting charges by feel. PVTS. MINA, YOUSSEF, KARIM.

Every phone in the back lights at once. One pale glow on every face.

