INT. GREAT PYRAMID, GRAND GALLERY - CONTINUOUS #125#

Its fist still on the thread, the Reis lunges. Fathi goes over backward on the great step, dagger up.

Along the thread, a glint runs, like dew in the sun.

The jackal mast stops an inch from Fathi's face. The Reis sits down on the step. Behind the black band, the slit brightens once.

REIS (AMUN'S VOICE)
Here am I.

INT. GREAT PYRAMID, HALL OF TWO TRUTHS - CONTINUOUS #126#

